{"fps": 30, "total": 162.548, "hash": "c634cf8f492e0e43", "chapters": [], "beats": [{"id": "k1", "text": "Rent rose faster than paychecks in eighty eight percent of counties.", "start": 0.08, "end": 2.721, "words": [{"text": "Rent", "start": 0.08, "end": 0.255}, {"text": "rose", "start": 0.274, "end": 0.449}, {"text": "faster", "start": 0.468, "end": 0.713}, {"text": "than", "start": 0.74, "end": 0.915}, {"text": "paychecks", "start": 0.934, "end": 1.284}, {"text": "in", "start": 1.323, "end": 1.428}, {"text": "eighty", "start": 1.439, "end": 1.684}, {"text": "eight", "start": 1.711, "end": 1.921}, {"text": "percent", "start": 1.944, "end": 2.224}, {"text": "of", "start": 2.255, "end": 2.36}, {"text": "counties.", "start": 2.372, "end": 2.721}]}, {"id": "k2", "text": "And twenty two million renters paid the price.", "start": 3.5434375, "end": 5.2774375, "words": [{"text": "And", "start": 3.543, "end": 3.678}, {"text": "twenty", "start": 3.693, "end": 3.929}, {"text": "two", "start": 3.955, "end": 4.09}, {"text": "million", "start": 4.105, "end": 4.374}, {"text": "renters", "start": 4.404, "end": 4.674}, {"text": "paid", "start": 4.704, "end": 4.872}, {"text": "the", "start": 4.891, "end": 5.026}, {"text": "price.", "start": 5.041, "end": 5.277}]}, {"id": "k3", "text": "So why is your rent so expensive?", "start": 6.303604166666666, "end": 7.543604166666666, "words": [{"text": "So", "start": 6.304, "end": 6.424}, {"text": "why", "start": 6.424, "end": 6.664}, {"text": "is", "start": 6.664, "end": 6.844}, {"text": "your", "start": 6.844, "end": 6.924}, {"text": "rent", "start": 6.924, "end": 7.064}, {"text": "so", "start": 7.064, "end": 7.224}, {"text": "expensive?", "start": 7.224, "end": 7.544}]}, {"id": "k4", "text": "You will see who profits and the one secret that fixes it.", "start": 8.599770833333332, "end": 11.219770833333332, "words": [{"text": "You", "start": 8.6, "end": 8.72}, {"text": "will", "start": 8.72, "end": 8.82}, {"text": "see", "start": 8.82, "end": 8.98}, {"text": "who", "start": 8.98, "end": 9.14}, {"text": "profits", "start": 9.14, "end": 9.52}, {"text": "and", "start": 9.52, "end": 9.92}, {"text": "the", "start": 9.92, "end": 10.04}, {"text": "one", "start": 10.04, "end": 10.18}, {"text": "secret", "start": 10.18, "end": 10.44}, {"text": "that", "start": 10.44, "end": 10.72}, {"text": "fixes", "start": 10.72, "end": 10.94}, {"text": "it.", "start": 10.94, "end": 11.22}]}, {"id": "c1_01", "text": "Every month I open my mailbox and my landlord leaves me a little surprise envelope.", "start": 13.586541666666667, "end": 17.558541666666667, "words": [{"text": "Every", "start": 13.587000000000002, "end": 13.845}, {"text": "month", "start": 13.874, "end": 14.133000000000001}, {"text": "I", "start": 14.161000000000001, "end": 14.247}, {"text": "open", "start": 14.257000000000001, "end": 14.472000000000001}, {"text": "my", "start": 14.496, "end": 14.625}, {"text": "mailbox", "start": 14.64, "end": 14.984}, {"text": "and", "start": 15.023000000000001, "end": 15.195}, {"text": "my", "start": 15.214, "end": 15.343}, {"text": "landlord", "start": 15.358, "end": 15.745000000000001}, {"text": "leaves", "start": 15.788, "end": 16.09}, {"text": "me", "start": 16.123, "end": 16.253}, {"text": "a", "start": 16.267, "end": 16.353}, {"text": "little", "start": 16.363, "end": 16.664}, {"text": "surprise", "start": 16.698, "end": 17.085}, {"text": "envelope.", "start": 17.128, "end": 17.559}]}, {"id": "c1_02", "text": "My rent goes up another fifty dollars while my salary stays completely flat.", "start": 18.174937500000002, "end": 21.4099375, "words": [{"text": "My", "start": 18.175, "end": 18.289}, {"text": "rent", "start": 18.302, "end": 18.493000000000002}, {"text": "goes", "start": 18.514, "end": 18.704}, {"text": "up", "start": 18.725, "end": 18.84}, {"text": "another", "start": 18.852, "end": 19.157}, {"text": "fifty", "start": 19.191, "end": 19.42}, {"text": "dollars", "start": 19.445, "end": 19.75}, {"text": "while", "start": 19.784000000000002, "end": 20.012}, {"text": "my", "start": 20.038, "end": 20.152}, {"text": "salary", "start": 20.165, "end": 20.432000000000002}, {"text": "stays", "start": 20.461000000000002, "end": 20.69}, {"text": "completely", "start": 20.715, "end": 21.134}, {"text": "flat.", "start": 21.181, "end": 21.41}]}, {"id": "c1_03", "text": "That rent notice in my hand is not just my personal problem.", "start": 22.103354166666666, "end": 24.923354166666666, "words": [{"text": "That", "start": 22.103, "end": 22.223}, {"text": "rent", "start": 22.223, "end": 22.343}, {"text": "notice", "start": 22.343, "end": 22.623}, {"text": "in", "start": 22.623, "end": 22.863}, {"text": "my", "start": 22.863, "end": 22.963}, {"text": "hand", "start": 22.963, "end": 23.263}, {"text": "is", "start": 23.263, "end": 23.583000000000002}, {"text": "not", "start": 23.583000000000002, "end": 23.783}, {"text": "just", "start": 23.783, "end": 23.983}, {"text": "my", "start": 23.983, "end": 24.203}, {"text": "personal", "start": 24.203, "end": 24.543}, {"text": "problem.", "start": 24.543, "end": 24.923000000000002}]}, {"id": "c1_04", "text": "Between two thousand and twenty twenty rent grew faster than income for almost every family.", "start": 25.684291666666667, "end": 29.848291666666665, "words": [{"text": "Between", "start": 25.684, "end": 26.009}, {"text": "two", "start": 26.045, "end": 26.208000000000002}, {"text": "thousand", "start": 26.226, "end": 26.592000000000002}, {"text": "and", "start": 26.632, "end": 26.795}, {"text": "twenty", "start": 26.813000000000002, "end": 27.098}, {"text": "twenty", "start": 27.129, "end": 27.414}, {"text": "rent", "start": 27.445, "end": 27.649}, {"text": "grew", "start": 27.671, "end": 27.874000000000002}, {"text": "faster", "start": 27.897000000000002, "end": 28.181}, {"text": "than", "start": 28.213, "end": 28.416}, {"text": "income", "start": 28.439, "end": 28.723}, {"text": "for", "start": 28.755, "end": 28.918}, {"text": "almost", "start": 28.936, "end": 29.220000000000002}, {"text": "every", "start": 29.252000000000002, "end": 29.496000000000002}, {"text": "family.", "start": 29.523, "end": 29.848}]}, {"id": "c1_05", "text": "Eighty eight percent of counties saw rents sprint ahead while wages crawled.", "start": 30.471854166666667, "end": 33.752854166666665, "words": [{"text": "Eighty", "start": 30.472, "end": 30.744}, {"text": "eight", "start": 30.774, "end": 31.007}, {"text": "percent", "start": 31.033, "end": 31.343}, {"text": "of", "start": 31.377000000000002, "end": 31.494}, {"text": "counties", "start": 31.507, "end": 31.856}, {"text": "saw", "start": 31.895, "end": 32.05}, {"text": "rents", "start": 32.067, "end": 32.3}, {"text": "sprint", "start": 32.326, "end": 32.598}, {"text": "ahead", "start": 32.628, "end": 32.861}, {"text": "while", "start": 32.887, "end": 33.119}, {"text": "wages", "start": 33.144999999999996, "end": 33.378}, {"text": "crawled.", "start": 33.403999999999996, "end": 33.753}]}, {"id": "c1_06", "text": "So tenants ended up spending over thirty percent of their whole income just on shelter.", "start": 34.511624999999995, "end": 38.411624999999994, "words": [{"text": "So", "start": 34.512, "end": 34.632}, {"text": "tenants", "start": 34.632, "end": 34.791999999999994}, {"text": "ended", "start": 34.791999999999994, "end": 35.132}, {"text": "up", "start": 35.132, "end": 35.312}, {"text": "spending", "start": 35.312, "end": 35.532}, {"text": "over", "start": 35.532, "end": 35.831999999999994}, {"text": "thirty", "start": 35.831999999999994, "end": 36.092}, {"text": "percent", "start": 36.092, "end": 36.431999999999995}, {"text": "of", "start": 36.431999999999995, "end": 36.632}, {"text": "their", "start": 36.632, "end": 36.751999999999995}, {"text": "whole", "start": 36.751999999999995, "end": 36.891999999999996}, {"text": "income", "start": 36.891999999999996, "end": 37.291999999999994}, {"text": "just", "start": 37.632, "end": 37.891999999999996}, {"text": "on", "start": 37.891999999999996, "end": 38.151999999999994}, {"text": "shelter.", "start": 38.151999999999994, "end": 38.412}]}, {"id": "c1_07", "text": "That makes you house poor before you even buy groceries.", "start": 39.238187499999995, "end": 41.5781875, "words": [{"text": "That", "start": 39.238, "end": 39.378}, {"text": "makes", "start": 39.378, "end": 39.558}, {"text": "you", "start": 39.558, "end": 39.738}, {"text": "house", "start": 39.738, "end": 39.937999999999995}, {"text": "poor", "start": 39.937999999999995, "end": 40.278}, {"text": "before", "start": 40.278, "end": 40.577999999999996}, {"text": "you", "start": 40.577999999999996, "end": 40.778}, {"text": "even", "start": 40.778, "end": 40.958}, {"text": "buy", "start": 40.958, "end": 41.178}, {"text": "groceries.", "start": 41.178, "end": 41.577999999999996}]}, {"id": "c1_08", "text": "And it gets worse when you see what happened to the actual houses.", "start": 42.70389583333333, "end": 45.063895833333326, "words": [{"text": "And", "start": 42.704, "end": 42.784}, {"text": "it", "start": 42.784, "end": 42.864}, {"text": "gets", "start": 42.864, "end": 42.943999999999996}, {"text": "worse", "start": 42.943999999999996, "end": 43.244}, {"text": "when", "start": 43.244, "end": 43.523999999999994}, {"text": "you", "start": 43.523999999999994, "end": 43.623999999999995}, {"text": "see", "start": 43.623999999999995, "end": 43.744}, {"text": "what", "start": 43.744, "end": 43.864}, {"text": "happened", "start": 43.864, "end": 44.064}, {"text": "to", "start": 44.064, "end": 44.303999999999995}, {"text": "the", "start": 44.303999999999995, "end": 44.424}, {"text": "actual", "start": 44.424, "end": 44.644}, {"text": "houses.", "start": 44.644, "end": 45.064}]}, {"id": "c2_01", "text": "Imagine ten people standing in line to rent five available apartments.", "start": 47.62258333333333, "end": 50.962583333333335, "words": [{"text": "Imagine", "start": 47.623000000000005, "end": 47.983000000000004}, {"text": "ten", "sta