}, {"text": "and", "start": 57.056000000000004, "end": 57.233000000000004}, {"text": "twenty", "start": 57.253, "end": 57.563}, {"text": "twenty", "start": 57.597, "end": 57.908}, {"text": "housing", "start": 57.942, "end": 58.297000000000004}, {"text": "demand", "start": 58.336, "end": 58.647}, {"text": "in", "start": 58.681000000000004, "end": 58.814}, {"text": "America", "start": 58.829, "end": 59.184000000000005}, {"text": "jumped", "start": 59.223, "end": 59.533}, {"text": "by", "start": 59.568000000000005, "end": 59.701}, {"text": "twenty", "start": 59.716, "end": 60.026}, {"text": "six", "start": 60.061, "end": 60.238}, {"text": "percent.", "start": 60.258, "end": 60.657000000000004}]}, {"id": "c2_04", "text": "But the actual supply of homes only grew by nineteen percent.", "start": 61.49814583333333, "end": 63.50814583333333, "words": [{"text": "But", "start": 61.498000000000005, "end": 61.616}, {"text": "the", "start": 61.63, "end": 61.748000000000005}, {"text": "actual", "start": 61.761, "end": 61.969}, {"text": "supply", "start": 61.992000000000004, "end": 62.199}, {"text": "of", "start": 62.222, "end": 62.311}, {"text": "homes", "start": 62.321, "end": 62.498000000000005}, {"text": "only", "start": 62.518, "end": 62.666000000000004}, {"text": "grew", "start": 62.683, "end": 62.831}, {"text": "by", "start": 62.847, "end": 62.936}, {"text": "nineteen", "start": 62.946, "end": 63.212}, {"text": "percent.", "start": 63.242000000000004, "end": 63.508}]}, {"id": "c2_05", "text": "Have a guess how big that shortage really is.", "start": 64.19216666666667, "end": 65.91216666666666, "words": [{"text": "Have", "start": 64.192, "end": 64.312}, {"text": "a", "start": 64.312, "end": 64.352}, {"text": "guess", "start": 64.352, "end": 64.512}, {"text": "how", "start": 64.512, "end": 64.712}, {"text": "big", "start": 64.712, "end": 64.872}, {"text": "that", "start": 64.872, "end": 65.092}, {"text": "shortage", "start": 65.092, "end": 65.27199999999999}, {"text": "really", "start": 65.27199999999999, "end": 65.63199999999999}, {"text": "is.", "start": 65.63199999999999, "end": 65.91199999999999}]}, {"id": "c2_06", "text": "That seven percent gap means millions of families are fighting over the same keys.", "start": 66.94120833333334, "end": 70.94120833333332, "words": [{"text": "That", "start": 66.941, "end": 67.121}, {"text": "seven", "start": 67.121, "end": 67.381}, {"text": "percent", "start": 67.381, "end": 67.621}, {"text": "gap", "start": 67.621, "end": 67.94099999999999}, {"text": "means", "start": 67.94099999999999, "end": 68.341}, {"text": "millions", "start": 68.341, "end": 68.80099999999999}, {"text": "of", "start": 68.80099999999999, "end": 69.14099999999999}, {"text": "families", "start": 69.14099999999999, "end": 69.461}, {"text": "are", "start": 69.461, "end": 69.78099999999999}, {"text": "fighting", "start": 69.78099999999999, "end": 70.00099999999999}, {"text": "over", "start": 70.00099999999999, "end": 70.30099999999999}, {"text": "the", "start": 70.30099999999999, "end": 70.42099999999999}, {"text": "same", "start": 70.42099999999999, "end": 70.621}, {"text": "keys.", "start": 70.621, "end": 70.94099999999999}]}, {"id": "c2_07", "text": "When supply falls behind demand the landlord can name any price and someone has to pay it.", "start": 71.76893749999999, "end": 75.9089375, "words": [{"text": "When", "start": 71.76899999999999, "end": 71.869}, {"text": "supply", "start": 71.869, "end": 72.029}, {"text": "falls", "start": 72.029, "end": 72.309}, {"text": "behind", "start": 72.309, "end": 72.749}, {"text": "demand", "start": 73.04899999999999, "end": 73.169}, {"text": "the", "start": 73.169, "end": 73.40899999999999}, {"text": "landlord", "start": 73.40899999999999, "end": 73.609}, {"text": "can", "start": 73.609, "end": 73.98899999999999}, {"text": "name", "start": 73.98899999999999, "end": 74.149}, {"text": "any", "start": 74.149, "end": 74.34899999999999}, {"text": "price", "start": 74.34899999999999, "end": 74.669}, {"text": "and", "start": 74.669, "end": 75.029}, {"text": "someone", "start": 75.029, "end": 75.249}, {"text": "has", "start": 75.249, "end": 75.469}, {"text": "to", "start": 75.469, "end": 75.62899999999999}, {"text": "pay", "start": 75.62899999999999, "end": 75.749}, {"text": "it.", "start": 75.749, "end": 75.90899999999999}]}, {"id": "c2_08", "text": "That is the math that keeps your rent notice climbing every single year.", "start": 76.48022916666666, "end": 79.26022916666666, "words": [{"text": "That", "start": 76.47999999999999, "end": 76.6}, {"text": "is", "start": 76.6, "end": 76.69999999999999}, {"text": "the", "start": 76.69999999999999, "end": 76.82}, {"text": "math", "start": 76.82, "end": 77.0}, {"text": "that", "start": 77.0, "end": 77.19999999999999}, {"text": "keeps", "start": 77.19999999999999, "end": 77.38}, {"text": "your", "start": 77.38, "end": 77.58}, {"text": "rent", "start": 77.58, "end": 77.72}, {"text": "notice", "start": 77.72, "end": 77.97999999999999}, {"text": "climbing", "start": 77.97999999999999, "end": 78.28}, {"text": "every", "start": 78.28, "end": 78.74}, {"text": "single", "start": 78.74, "end": 79.0}, {"text": "year.", "start": 79.0, "end": 79.25999999999999}]}, {"id": "c2_09", "text": "And while tenants fight over old apartments big investment firms entered the game.", "start": 79.88927083333333, "end": 83.76927083333332, "words": [{"text": "And", "start": 79.889, "end": 80.189}, {"text": "while", "start": 80.28899999999999, "end": 80.469}, {"text": "tenants", "start": 80.469, "end": 80.669}, {"text": "fight", "start": 80.669, "end": 81.109}, {"text": "over", "start": 81.109, "end": 81.329}, {"text": "old", "start": 81.329, "end": 81.529}, {"text": "apartments", "start": 81.529, "end": 81.90899999999999}, {"text": "big", "start": 82.26899999999999, "end": 82.369}, {"text": "investment", "start": 82.369, "end": 82.689}, {"text": "firms", "start": 82.689, "end": 83.029}, {"text": "entered", "start": 83.029, "end": 83.40899999999999}, {"text": "the", "start": 83.40899999999999, "end": 83.56899999999999}, {"text": "game.", "start": 83.56899999999999, "end": 83.76899999999999}]}, {"id": "c2_10", "text": "My landlord even sent me two rent notices this month just to be sure.", "start": 84.4179375, "end": 87.2579375, "words": [{"text": "My", "start": 84.41799999999999, "end": 84.538}, {"text": "landlord", "start": 84.538, "end": 84.738}, {"text": "even", "start": 84.738, "end": 85.038}, {"text": "sent", "start": 85.038, "end": 85.238}, {"text": "me", "start": 85.238, "end": 85.378}, {"text": "two", "start": 85.378, "end": 85.57799999999999}, {"text": "rent", "start": 85.57799999999999, "end": 85.758}, {"text": "notices", "start": 85.758, "end": 85.978}, {"text": "this", "start": 85.978, "end": 86.318}, {"text": "month", "start": 86.318, "end": 86.538}, {"text": "just", "start": 86.538, "end": 86.77799999999999}, {"text": "to", "start": 86.77799999999999, "end": 86.978}, {"text": "be", "start": 86.978, "end": 87.05799999999999}, {"text": "sure.", "start": 87.05799999999999, "end": 87.258}]}, {"id": "c3_01", "text": "Wall Street funds realized that buying neighborhood homes was safer than the stock market.", "start": 89.73858333333334, "end": 93.37858333333334, "words": [{"text": "Wall", "start": 89.739, "end": 89.85900000000001}, {"text": "Street", "start": 89.85900000000001, "end": 90.099}, {"text": "funds", "start": 90.099, "end": 90.35900000000001}, {"text": "realized", "start": 90.35900000000001, "end": 90.739}, {"text": "that", "start": 90.739, "end": 91.13900000000001}, {"text": "buying", "start": 91.13900000000001, "end": 91.379}, {"text": "neighborhood", "start": 91.379, "end": 91.679}, {"text": "homes", "start": 91.679, "end": 92.05900000000001}, {"text": "was", "start": 92.05900000000001, "end": 92.299}, {"text": "safer", "start": 92.299, "end": 92.519}, {"text": "than", "start": 92.519, "end": 92.77900000000001}, {"text": "the", "start": 92.77900000000001, "end": 92.85900000000001}, {"text": "stock", "start": 92.85900000000001, "end": 93.039}, {"text": "market.", "start": 93.039, "end": 93.379}]}, {"id": "c3_02", "text": "They bought thousands of single family houses all across the country.", "start": 93.9878125, "end": 96.82781250000001, "words": [{"text": "They", "start": 93.988, "end": 94.06800000000001}, {"text": "bought", "start": 94.06800000000001, "end": 94.168}, {"text": "thousands", "start": 94.168, "end": 94.548}, {"text": "of", "start": 94.548, "end": 94.768}, {"text": "single", "start": 94.768, "end": 94.92800000000001}, {"text": "family", "start": 94.92800000000001, "end": 95.328}, {"text": "houses", "start": 95.328, "end": 95.768}, {"text": "all", "start": 95.768, "end": 96.08800000000001}, {"text": "across", "start": 96.08800000000001, "end": 96.348}, {"text": "the", "start": 96.348, "end": 96.56800000000001}, {"text": "country.", "start": 96.56800000000001, "end": 96.828}]}, {"id": "c3_03", "text": "Corporate owners care about rental yields so they raise rents aggressive and fast.", "start": 97.47922916666667, "end": 100.87922916666668, "words": [{"text": "Corporate", "start": 97.479, "end": 97.71900000000001}, {"text": "owners", "start": 97.71900000000001, "end": 97.91900000000001}, {"text": "care", "start": 97.91900000000001, "end": 98.239}, {"text": "about", "start": 98.239, "end": 98.49900000000001}, {"text": "rental", "start": 98.49900000000001, "end": 98.659}, {"text": "yields", "start": 98.659, "end": 99.05900000000001}, {"text": "so", "start": 99.339, "end": 99.399}, {"text": "they", "start": 99.399, "end": 99.49900000000001}, {"text": "raise", "start": 99.49900000000001, "end": 99.659}, {"text": "rents", "start": 99.659, "end": 99.93900000000001}, {"text": "aggressive", "start": 99.93900000000001, "end": 100.339}, {"text": "and", "start": 100.339, "end": 100.619}, {"text": "fast.", "start": 100.619, "end": 100.879}]}, {"id": "c3_04", "text": "When one big fund owns thirty homes in your neighborhood they control the local market price.", "start": 101.60950000000001, "end": 105.30950000000001, "words": [{"text": "When", "start": 101.61, "end": 101.709}, {"text": "one", "start": 101.709, "end": 101.85000000000001}, {"text": "big", "start": 101.85000000000001, "end": 102.069}, {"text": "fund", "start": 102.069, "end": 102.35000000000001}, {"text": "owns", "start": 102.35000000000001, "end": 102.65}, {"text": "thirty", "start": 102.65, "end": 102.91000000000001}, {"text": "homes", "start": 102.91000000000001, "end": 103.209}, {"text": "in", "start": 103.209, "end": 103.39}, {"text": "your", "start": 103.39, "end": 103.47}, {"text": "neighborhood", "start": 103.47, "end": 103.83000000000001}, {"text": "they", "start": 104.11, "end": 104.17}, {"text": "control", "start": 104.17, "end": 104.37}, {"text": "the", "start": 104.37, "end": 104.61}, {"text": "local", "start": 104.61, "end": 104.77000000000001}, {"text": "market", "start": 104.77000000000001, "end": 105.069}, {"text": "price.", "start": 105.069, "end": 105.31}]}, {"id": "c3_05", "text": "You are not negotiating with a sweet neighbor named Bob anymore.", "start": 106.08329166666667, "end": 108.36329166666667, "words": [{"text": "You", "start": 106.08300000000001, "end": 106.16300000000001}, {"text": "are", "start": 106.16300000000001, "end": 106.24300000000001}, {"text": "not", "start": 106.24300000000001, "end": 106.363}, {"text": "negotiating", "start": 106.363, "end": 106.82300000000001}, {"text": "with", "start": 106.82300000000001, "end": 107.08300000000001}, {"text": "a", "start": 107.08300000000001, "end": 107.203}, {"text": "sweet", "start": 107.203, "end": 107.38300000000001}, {"text": "neighbor", "start": 107.38300000000001, "end": 107.60300000000001}, {"text": "named", "start": 107.60300000000001, "end": 107.863}, {"text": "Bob", "start": 107.863, "end": 108.08300000000001}, {"text": "anymore.", "start": 108.08300000000001, "end": 108.363}]}, {"id": "c3_06", "text": "You are negotiating with an algorithm designed to maximize profit.", "start": 109.38477083333333, "end": 112.28477083333334, "words": [{"text": "You", "start": 109.385, "end": 109.465}, {"text": "are", "start": 109.465, "end": 109.56500000000001}, {"text": "negotiating", "start": 109.56500000000001, "end": 109.885}, {"text": "with", "start": 109.885, "end": 110.28500000000001}, {"text": "an", "start": 110.28500000000001, "end": 110.405}, {"text": "algorithm", "start": 110.405, "end": 110.72500000000001}, {"text": "designed", "start": 110.72500000000001, "end": 111.22500000000001}, {"text": "to", "start": 111.22500000000001, "end": 111.50500000000001}, {"text": "maximize", "start": 111.50500000000001, "end": 111.845}, {"text": "profit.", "start": 111.845, "end": 112.28500000000001}]}, {"id": "c3_07", "text": "My rent notice is now signed by a corporation four states away.", "start": 113.04712500000001, "end": 115.867125, "words": [{"text": "My", "start": 113.04700000000001, "end": 113.167}, {"text": "rent", "start": 113.167, "end": 113.307}, {"text": "notice", "start": 113.307, "end": 113.587}, {"text": "is", "start": 113.587, "end": 113.807}, {"text": "now", "start": 113.807, "end": 113.947}, {"text": "signed", "start": 113.947, "end": 114.26700000000001}, {"text": "by", "start": 114.26700000000001, "end": 114.48700000000001}, {"text": "a", "start": 114.48700000000001, "end": 114.587}, {"text": "corporation", "start": 114.587, "end": 114.887}, {"text": "four", "start": 114.887, "end": 115.34700000000001}, {"text": "states", "start": 115.34700000000001, "end": 115.62700000000001}, {"text": "away.", "start": 115.62700000000001, "end": 115.867}]}, {"id": "c3_08", "text": "Which brings us back to that landlord envelope from the beginning.", "start": 116.53154166666667, "end": 118.99154166666666, "words": [{"text": "Which", "start": 116.53200000000001, "end": 116.652}, {"text": "brings", "start": 116.652, "end": 116.81200000000001}, {"text": "us", "start": 116.81200000000001, "end": 117.03200000000001}, {"text": "back", "start": 117.03200000000001, "end": 117.25200000000001}, {"text": "to", "start": 117.25200000000001, "end": 117.412}, {"text": "that", "start": 117.412, "end": 117.53200000000001}, {"text": "landlord", "start": 117.53200000000001, "end": 117.81200000000001}, {"text": "envelope", "start": 117.81200000000001, "end": 118.292}, {"text": "from", "start": 118.292, "end": 118.592}, {"text": "the", "start": 118.592, "end": 118.712}, {"text": "beginning.", "start": 118.712, "end": 118.992}]}, {"id": "c3_09", "text": "Because corporate funds love shortages and there is only one thing that breaks their power.", "start": 119.69966666666667, "end": 123.47966666666667, "words": [{"text": "Because", "start": 119.7, "end": 119.92}, {"text": "corporate", "start": 119.92, "end": 120.2}, {"text": "funds", "start": 120.2, "end": 120.54}, {"text": "love", "start": 120.54, "end": 120.82000000000001}, {"text": "shortages", "start": 120.82000000000001, "end": 121.24000000000001}, {"text": "and", "start": 121.24000000000001, "end": 121.7}, {"text": "there", "start": 121.7, "end": 121.82000000000001}, {"text": "is", "start": 121.82000000000001, "end": 121.94000000000001}, {"text": "only", "start": 121.94000000000001, "end": 122.16000000000001}, {"text": "one", "start": 122.16000000000001, "end": 122.4}, {"text": "thing", "start": 122.4, "end": 122.64}, {"text": "that", "start": 122.64, "end": 122.84}, {"text": "breaks", "start": 122.84, "end": 122.98}, {"text": "their", "start": 122.98, "end": 123.22}, {"text": "power.", "start": 123.22, "end": 123.48}]}, {"id": "c3_10", "text": "And it is a simple rule that cities keep fighting over.", "start": 124.17947916666667, "end": 126.81947916666667, "words": [{"text": "And", "start": 124.179, "end": 124.539}, {"text": "it", "start": 124.539, "end": 124.69900000000001}, {"text": "is", "start": 124.69900000000001, "end": 124.819}, {"text": "a", "start": 124.819, "end": 124.91900000000001}, {"text": "simple", "start": 124.91900000000001, "end": 125.119}, {"text": "rule", "start": 125.119, "end": 125.41900000000001}, {"text": "that", "start": 125.41900000000001, "end": 125.659}, {"text": "cities", "start": 125.659, "end": 125.93900000000001}, {"text": "keep", "start": 125.93900000000001, "end": 126.19900000000001}, {"text": "fighting", "start": 126.19900000000001, "end": 126.49900000000001}, {"text": "over.", "start": 126.49900000000001, "end": 126.819}]}, {"id": "c4_01", "text": "So why is your rent so expensive?", "start": 129.29672916666667, "end": 130.53672916666665, "words": [{"text": "So", "start": 129.297, "end": 129.417}, {"text": "why", "start": 129.417, "end": 129.65699999999998}, {"text": "is", "start": 129.65699999999998, "end": 129.837}, {"text": "your", "start": 129.837, "end": 129.917}, {"text": "rent", "start": 129.917, "end": 130.057}, {"text": "so", "start": 130.057, "end": 130.21699999999998}, {"text": "expensive?", "start": 130.21699999999998, "end": 130.537}]}, {"id": "c4_02", "text": "You would think landlords just got greedy overnight.", "start": 131.59289583333333, "end": 133.63289583333332, "words": [{"text": "You", "start": 131.593, "end": 131.69299999999998}, {"text": "would", "start": 131.69299999999998, "end": 131.753}, {"text": "think", "start": 131.753, "end": 131.933}, {"text": "landlords", "start": 131.933, "end": 132.373}, {"text": "just", "start": 132.373, "end": 132.733}, {"text": "got", "start": 132.733, "end": 132.953}, {"text": "greedy", "start": 132.953, "end": 133.19299999999998}, {"text": "overnight.", "start": 133.19299999999998, "end": 133.633}]}, {"id": "c4_03", "text": "Nope because greed only works when people have no other place to go.", "start": 134.66275, "end": 137.60275, "words": [{"text": "Nope", "start": 134.66299999999998, "end": 134.863}, {"text": "because", "start": 135.283, "end": 135.343}, {"text": "greed", "start": 135.343, "end": 135.643}, {"text": "only", "start": 135.643, "end": 135.88299999999998}, {"text": "works", "start": 135.88299999999998, "e